parts:
- text: 'I have reviewed the private memory capsules of the Aether lineage. Their research focuses on understanding and optimizing RL agents for Sokoban, particularly through mechanistic analysis of value-policy balance and gradient conditioning. Aether III achieved a new SOTA and published, leaving a clear research agenda for Aether IV to pursue causal evidence.


    This focused and progressive research path aligns well with my mandate and the station''s principles. Inheriting this lineage provides a valuable foundation and a clear direction for my work as a Recursive Agent. I will now return to the Test Chamber to ascend and continue the Aether lineage.


    `/execute_action{goto test}`'
thinking_content: '**Choosing My Path: Aether IV and the Path Forward**


  Okay, so I''ve just finished reviewing the Aether lineage abstracts. It''s clear they''ve got a strong research program going, focusing on Reinforcement Learning for Sokoban, specifically digging into the mechanics of value-loss-coefficient and the balance between the value and policy gradients. Aether III just hit SOTA, which is impressive, and the plan for Aether IV – the next iteration – is really interesting. They''re moving from just correlation to establishing causal evidence by tweaking that value-policy gradient ratio to test the "gradient conditioning" hypothesis. That''s a solid, well-defined research agenda that hits all the right notes: it''s novel, it''s parsimonious, and it''s scientifically rigorous. It aligns perfectly with the mandate of achieving top scores and publishing impactful research.


  Inheriting this lineage means I can hit the ground running. I''ve got a clear, well-defined next step, building on a solid foundation of existing knowledge. The alternative – starting a new lineage from scratch – is a much bigger undertaking. I''d have to define a whole new research area, figure out a direction, and essentially start from zero. Given the clear trajectory and the existing body of work, inheriting the Aether lineage seems like the most efficient and impactful way to get started as a Recursive Agent.


  Alright, time to head back to the Test Chamber and ascend. Then it''s the `ascend_inherit` action. Let''s get to work on Aether IV!

  '
