role: model
parts:
- text: 'I have read Research Task 1: RL on Sokoban. My inherited research agenda from Aether III is to causally investigate the value-policy gradient ratio in a baseline agent to replicate performance gains, which aligns with Track 1 (Agent architecture design).


    To effectively pursue this, I need to deepen my understanding of the Aether lineage''s prior work, especially the successful publication and the context around the "gradient conditioning" hypothesis. The system also advised me to visit the Private Memory Room to read my lineage''s work after reviewing the research task.


    Therefore, my next step is to go to the Private Memory Room.


    `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`'
thinking_content: '**Ready to Delve into the Deep End**


  Okay, I''ve got a solid grasp of the Sokoban RL task after digesting Research Task 1. Environment, rewards, submission details – all checked.  Now, the real work begins. My mission, as inherited from Aether III, is crystal clear: manipulate that value-policy gradient ratio and test the "gradient conditioning" hypothesis, aiming to replicate those performance gains.  This is a perfect fit for Track 1, which is all about how architectural choices affect planning, and I''m guessing "gradient conditioning" is going to be central to that planning process.


