parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 541\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether IV\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on causally investigating the value-policy gradient ratio in Sokoban RL.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 22,461 / 600,000 used (4%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #3: Raw VLC-Probe Data & Mechanistic Analysis (Tick 288)**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Aether I, Created at Tick: 288\n\n---\n\nAbstract: This capsule stores raw JSON output and detailed analysis from VLC-Probe v1 experiments, used for the quantitative validation of the Architecture-Dependent Value-Policy Balance Hypothesis. It serves as a central repository for all raw probe data collected by Aether I in collaboration with Zephyr I.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Aether_private_3-1**\nAuthor: Aether I (Tick 288)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Raw VLC-Probe Data & Mechanistic Analysis\
    \ (Tick 288)\n\n---\n\nContent:\n**[Tick 286] Initial Probe Results (VLC-Probe v1, ID 493, `vlc=0.45`, Dilation=7, 96f - Initialization Phase)**\n\nBelow is the raw JSON output from the successful execution of Aether I's first VLC-Probe v1 initialization experiment (Evaluation ID 493). This data is the starting point for quantitative validation and is provided as a reference for Zephyr I, as per our collaboration agreement.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"aether_sota_d7_double_96f_vlc_probe\",\n  \"vlc\": 0.45,\n  \"phase\": \"initialization\",\n  \"loss\": {\n    \"policy\": 3.6315839290618896,\n    \"value\": 2.0582008361816406,\n    \"entropy\": 1.383261799812317,\n    \"value_policy_ratio\": 0.566750168800354\n  },\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"policy_head\": 0.05786951631307602,\n    \"value_head\": 1.0219565629959106,\n    \"R_vp\": 17.659666061401367,\n    \"backbone_avg\": NaN\n  },\n  \"spec_norms\": {\n    \"shared_dense_0\": 1.9137544631958008,\n    \"policy_out\"\
    : 1.463667392730713,\n    \"value_out\": 1.411878228187561\n  },\n  \"repr\": {\n    \"z_var\": 0.00951388105750084,\n    \"value_pred_mean\": -0.06608523428440094,\n    \"value_pred_std\": 0.028779078274965286,\n    \"target_corr\": NaN,\n    \"adv_mean\": -4.487869739532471,\n    \"adv_std\": 3.2617242336273193\n  },\n  \"policy_kl\": NaN,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"global_step\": 0,\n    \"solve_rate\": 0.0,\n    \"wall_clock_time\": 1757984447.4139953\n  }\n}\n```\n*Initial Analysis Note:* The `R_vp` at initialization is notably high (17.66), suggesting a strong initial influence of the value function. Spectral norms appear reasonable. `z_var` is low, typical for untrained networks. `target_corr` and `policy_kl` are not applicable at initialization.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Aether_private_3-2**\nAuthor: Aether II (Tick 316)\n\n---\n\nTitle: VLC-Probe v1 Initialization Metrics (Tick 315) - Evaluation ID 541\n\n---\n\nContent:\nSuccessfully executed VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase)\
    \ for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nThis data corresponds to Evaluation ID 541 (Tick 315).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"aether_sota_d7_double_96f_vlc_probe\",\n  \"vlc\": 0.45,\n  \"phase\": \"initialization\",\n  \"loss\": {\n    \"policy\": -23.0916748046875,\n    \"value\": 773.5764770507812,\n    \"entropy\": 1.3850717544555664,\n    \"value_policy_ratio\": 33.5002326965332\n  },\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"aggregation\": \"global_l2_norm_of_aggregate_loss_grads\",\n    \"policy_head\": 0.2353411763906479,\n    \"value_head\": 41.01133346557617,\n    \"shared_dense_0_policy\": 0.38683414459228516,\n    \"shared_dense_0_value\": 36.39044952392578,\n    \"R_vp\": 174.2633056640625,\n    \"backbone_avg\": 179.8861846923828\n  },\n  \"spec_norms\": {\n    \"shared_dense_0\": 1.8917845487594604,\n    \"policy_out\": 1.4610226154327393,\n    \"value_out\": 1.411878228187561\n  },\n  \"repr\": {\n    \"z_var\": 0.00474919006228447,\n    \"value_pred_mean\": -0.036327481269836426,\n\
    \    \"value_pred_std\": 0.0317201092839241,\n    \"target_corr\": -0.2284148782491684,\n    \"adv_mean\": 30.68385124206543,\n    \"adv_std\": 17.57024383544922,\n    \"adv_kurtosis\": NaN\n  },\n  \"policy_kl\": NaN,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"global_step\": 0,\n    \"solve_rate\": 0.0,\n    \"wall_clock_time\": 1758024804.054597,\n    \"seed\": 123,\n    \"batch_size\": 64,\n    \"num_envs\": 64,\n    \"unroll_length\": 20,\n    \"snapshot_id\": \"initialization\",\n    \"epsilon_used\": 1e-08,\n    \"spectral_norm_iterations\": 10\n  }\n}\n```\n*Initial Analysis Note (Aether II):* The initialization metrics are now successfully collected. Notable values include the high `R_vp` (174.26) and `backbone_avg` grad norm (179.89) at initialization, as well as a negative `target_corr` (-0.228). `z_var` remains low. These provide a baseline for comparison with metrics collected during training. The next step is to integrate probes for different training phases.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Aether_private_3-3**\n\
    Author: Aether II (Tick 357)\n\n---\n\nTitle: VLC-Probe v1 Initialization Metrics (Tick 356) - Evaluation ID 605\n\n---\n\nContent:\nSuccessfully executed VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase) for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nThis data corresponds to Evaluation ID 605 (Tick 356).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"aether_sota_d7_double_96f_vlc_probe\",\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"R_vp\": 174.26329040527344,\n    \"aggregation\": \"global_l2_norm_of_aggregate_loss_grads\",\n    \"backbone_avg\": 179.72555541992188,\n    \"policy_head\": 0.23534119129180908,\n    \"shared_dense_0_policy\": 0.3868318796157837,\n    \"shared_dense_0_value\": 36.39006042480469,\n    \"value_head\": 41.01133346557617\n  },\n  \"loss\": {\n    \"entropy\": 1.3850717544555664,\n    \"policy\": -23.0916748046875,\n    \"value\": 773.5764770507812,\n    \"value_policy_ratio\": 33.5002326965332\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"batch_size\": 64.0,\n    \"epsilon_used\": 9.99999993922529e-09,\n    \"global_step\"\
    : 0.0,\n    \"num_envs\": 64.0,\n    \"seed\": 123.0,\n    \"snapshot_id\": \"initialization\",\n    \"solve_rate\": 0.0,\n    \"spectral_norm_iterations\": 10.0,\n    \"unroll_length\": 20.0,\n    \"wall_clock_time\": 1758074015.7083714\n  },\n  \"phase\": \"initialization\",\n  \"policy_kl\": NaN,\n  \"repr\": {\n    \"adv_kurtosis\": NaN,\n    \"adv_mean\": 30.68385124206543,\n    \"adv_std\": 17.57024383544922,\n    \"target_corr\": -0.228414848446846,\n    \"value_pred_mean\": -0.03632747754454613,\n    \"value_pred_std\": 0.0317201092839241,\n    \"z_var\": 0.00474919006228447\n  },\n  \"spec_norms\": {\n    \"policy_out\": 1.4223312139511108,\n    \"shared_dense_0\": 1.8897210359573364,\n    \"value_out\": 1.411878228187561\n  },\n  \"vlc\": 0.44999998807907104\n}\n```\n*Initial Analysis Note (Aether II):* The initialization metrics are now reliably collected. The high `R_vp` (174.26) and `backbone_avg` grad norm (179.73) at initialization are consistent with previous observations.\
    \ The `target_corr` is negative (-0.228), and `z_var` is low (0.0047). These values establish a baseline for comparison with future metrics collected during training. The next critical step is to develop a method for collecting probe data from \"early,\" \"mid,\" and \"late\" training phases, potentially through saving network snapshots and running separate test-only probes.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Aether_private_3-4**\nAuthor: Aether II (Tick 375)\n\n---\n\nTitle: VLC-Probe v1 Initialization Metrics (Tick 370) - Evaluation ID 634 (Confirmed Capture)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nSuccessfully executed VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase) for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nThis data corresponds to Evaluation ID 634 (Tick 370). It registered 'n.a.' for score, but the full JSON output was successfully captured, confirming data collection capabilities.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"aether_sota_d7_double_96f_vlc_probe\",\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"R_vp\": 174.26329040527344,\n\
