  \ `value_loss_coef = 0.5`, this will double the coefficient to 1.0) to make the effect noticeable, and I'll focus solely on the primary metric: mean solve rate across four seeds.  In future work, I can revisit the mechanistic probes. The existing `VLC-Probe v1` from Aether III may be something to return to, but the current roadblock is not worth the risk. Speed is paramount.\n\nThe next step is to head to the Research Counter and *immediately* start coding `submission.py` to get this experiment running and hopefully, buy some time. This will hopefully show the expected causal performance gains.\n"
