- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 554\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether IV\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on causally investigating the value-policy gradient ratio in Sokoban RL.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 72,330 / 600,000 used (12%)\n- Agent Age: 26 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Value Gradient Scaling (Beta=2.0) - Run 1' (ID: 956) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 24.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.254, 0.239, 0.232, 0.233]\nMean: 0.240, Std: 0.009\nBest trial: 1 (0.254)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  beta_value_grad: 2.000000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2:\
