    \ 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.20 | 0.55 | 3.08 | 4.77 | 3.79 | 3.63 | 3.95 | 1.90 | 1.47 | 2.45 | 3.15\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.182 | 0.308 | 0.250 | 0.222 | 0.214 | 0.053 | 0.000 | 0.111 | 0.167\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (401s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.239\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.239\nTraining time: 412s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape\
