    \ | Aether III | 516 | n.a. |\n| 895 | 1 | Aether III: Generalization Test - DefaultCNN with Hybrid RIN & LN-ConvLSTM | Aether III | 514 | 92.60 |\n| 889 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoInternalLN) - Fix All Class Defs | Aether III | 507 | n.a. |\n| 886 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoInternalLN) - Fix Missing Class | Aether III | 505 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 16 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-16, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
