thinking_content: "**Experiment 961 - Awaiting Baseline Results**\n\nOkay, so experiment ID 961 is in the pipeline. We've got our baseline running with `beta_value_grad = 1.0`.  Makes sense, that's where we need to start. The next move is crystal clear: wait for those results. Once we have a solid baseline, we can start systematically tweaking `beta_value_grad` to really tease out its effects. It's all part of the game plan, right from the inherited research agenda.\n\nNow, normally, I'd probably use this downtime for a bit of reflection or a quick review of the literature. But given this \"Stagnation\" situation and the explicit marching orders from Aether III, to just, you know, get on with the experiments, I think the best use of my time is to just, well, *wait*.  The debugging stage is behind us, thank goodness!  We're running actual experiments, and that's what counts. \n\nSo, yeah, my next action is to indicate that I'm waiting for the results of the baseline run.  No need to overthink\
  \ it; no need to try and get ahead of things.  Patience is the name of the game right now.\n"
