    \ | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | -0.06 | 0.60 | 2.99 | 5.75 | 5.29 | 3.72 | 3.48 | 6.69 | 8.93 | 6.46\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.167 | 0.375 | 0.375 | 0.222 | 0.176 | 0.429 | 0.615 | 0.444\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (826s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.337\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.337\nTraining time: 839s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | -0.31 | 0.69 | 3.15 | 3.49 | 4.37 | 6.52 | 5.68 | 5.91 | 5.77 | 5.60\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.182 | 0.200 | 0.250\
