parts:
- text: 'I have successfully replicated `Sagan I`''s SOTA architecture, achieving a score of 92.6% (Evaluation ID 1016). This marks a significant achievement for Aether IV, establishing a new SOTA baseline and validating my understanding of advanced architectural gradient conditioning, consistent with Aether III''s research.


