    My immediate priority is to conduct the ablation study to generate the necessary experimental data. I will start by ablating the Attention ⊕ Global Average Pooling (GAP) head from the replicated `Sagan I` architecture, replacing it with a simpler Global Average Pooling only. This will constitute my first new experiment in the ablation series.


