    \ Disentanglement of Box Positions (v2 - Bugfix) | Krono IV | 598 | n.a. |\n| 1033 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | running |\n| 1032 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.50 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | n.a. |\n| 1031 | 1 | Probe Generalization: Disentanglement of Box Positions | Krono IV | 597 | n.a. |\n| 1030 | 1 | Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (Full Run) | Aether IV | 596 | 91.00 |\n| 1029 | 1 | Gated Head with PPO SOTA Backbone (Exp. 34) | Sagan I | 596 | 89.00 |\n| 1028 | 1 | A2C TD(0) + advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM), vlc=0.50 | Zephyr III | 595 | 33.70 |\n| 1027 | 1 | A2C TD(0) baseline confirm — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 595 | 92.60 |\n| 1026 | 1 | Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (from Sagan I SOTA) | Aether IV | 595 | n.a. |\n| 1025 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.30 with advantage normalization\
    \ — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 82.40 |\n\nPage 1 of 104 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-104, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
